{"componentChunkName":"component---src-templates-areaguide-detail-template-js","path":"/area-guides/meydan-avenue/","result":{"data":{"strapiAreaGuide":{"id":"c652ea0a-32ba-5eb3-9f00-5048fae62e81","description":{"data":{"description":"<p>Meydan Avenue is located within Meydan City and is a quiet and quaint neighbourhood. It is just minutes from Business Bay and is close to the famous Meydan Grandstand. It is a mixed-use community offering commercial, residential as well as leisure.</p>"}},"video_ask_url":null,"amenities":{"strapi_json_value":[],"id":"13d74c91-6e8c-5de4-a832-62c107b21c8e"},"title":"Meydan Avenue","tile_image":{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/meydan_avenue_feature_c80f27fc5c.jpg"},"masterplan_image":null,"sponsored_projects":[],"teams":[],"strapi_id":60,"slug":"meydan-avenue","custom_property_slug":null,"publish":true,"more_info":[{"strapi_id":501,"question":"Area","id":"127ee4d8-a21f-5126-9a93-fad10898dad8","answer":{"data":{"answer":"<p>Meydan City is home to the Meydan Grandstand, and Meydan Avenue is located just minutes away from it. It has vast outdoor areas, perfect for kids with the many parks and play areas. You can enjoy the 3.5km long winding walkways and the biking lanes. It also has a lovely 500m Broadwalk, which is home to entertainment options, as well as retail and food joints.</p><p><img src=\"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i.prod/meydan_avenue3_df161313e1.jpg\" alt=\"meydan-avenue3.jpg\"></p>","id":"bb914131-a9f3-5870-a9f0-29100be0a4db"}}},{"strapi_id":502,"question":"Properties","id":"99e3c86a-de1d-5cdf-86fb-76d31a4ddac2","answer":{"data":{"answer":"<p>In Meydan Avenue, you can choose from beautifully crafted apartments and villas with private gardens. With 37 apartment buildings and villas within clusters, you can rent or buy an apartment or villa in Meydan Avenue. If you want to check out apartments for sale in Meydan Avenue or apartments for sale in Meydan Avenue, just talk to one of our experts. Alternatively, if you want to buy a villa in Meydan Avenue or rent a villa in Meydan Avenue, we can help you with that too.</p><p><img src=\"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i.prod/meydan_avenue2_e38c2c3bd4.jpg\" alt=\"meydan-avenue2.jpg\"></p>","id":"2827f38d-5d17-5030-a2c9-d5f1dfd4b3c6"}}},{"strapi_id":503,"question":"Location","id":"2d16a2f3-9f84-540f-b61e-9ecdb9bfe804","answer":{"data":{"answer":"<p>Meydan Avenue is located in Meydan City, which is easily accessible from all major landmarks of the city. It is next to Al Quoz, The Villa as well as Dubai Silicon Oasis. Not just that, it is close to MBR City, and minutes from Business Bay.</p><ul><li>04 mins – Meydan Grandstand</li><li>08 mins – MBR City | Business Bay</li><li>10 mins – Downtown Dubai | Burj Khalifa</li><li>14 mins – Dubai International Airport | Mall of Emirates |Dubai Silicon Oasis</li><li>18 mins – Dubai Marina</li><li>20 mins – Palm Jumeirah</li></ul>","id":"e30d48f3-a857-5a56-a339-45a1d2b26f62"}}},{"strapi_id":504,"question":"Conveniences","id":"e9a61036-98b4-5b48-b07e-82da29e8baef","answer":{"data":{"answer":"<h3>Shopping in Meydan Avenue:</h3><p>As a resident of Meydan Avenue, you will have easy access to Meydan One mall, which houses over 500 retail stores as well as restaurants, crystal lagoon, a 21-screen cinema, indoor ski slope, as well as a winter village. You can also head to Dubai Mall and Souk Al Bahar, which are a short drive away.&nbsp;</p><p>If you want to get your grocery shopping done, &nbsp;you can head to the Wallmart Hypermarket as well as the hypermarkets in Meydan One Mall.</p><p><img src=\"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i.prod/meydan_crystal_lagoon1_b56060d272.jpg\" alt=\"meydan-crystal-lagoon1.jpg\"></p><h3>Restaurants for Residents:</h3><p>Meydan Avenue residents can go to the few restaurants around the community, or head to the Meydan One Mall. Downtown Dubai and Business Bay are also home to amazing fine-dining and casual-dining restaurants.</p><p><img src=\"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i.prod/meydan_one_mall_5b33884175.jpg\" alt=\"meydan-one-mall.jpg\"></p><h3>Beaches:</h3><p>If you live in Meydan Avenue and want to chill at the beach, you can head to the Jumeirah Public Beach or Kite Beach. You can take part in many water-sports activities on these beaches.</p><h3>Fitness Facilities:</h3><p>If you are a fitness enthusiast, Meydan City has got you covered. You can go racing, golfing and cycling within the community. There are also parks and open spaces for everyone to enjoy.</p><h3>Schools &amp; Health:</h3><p>If you have kids, you can enrol them at the many nurseries and schools. You can also enrol them at Knowledge Park or Academic City.</p><p>As residents of Meydan Avenue, you can get healthcare facilities at Al Garhoud Private Hospital or Nad Al Sheba Health Centre, all just minutes away from Meydan Avenue.</p><p>Thus, if you are looking for apartments for sale in Meydan Avenue or villas for sale in Meydan Avenue, or even properties for rent in Meydan Avenue, connect with our experts today.</p>","id":"188ec310-5d56-5a7d-97d3-004da096619a"}}}],"longitude":55.2912346,"latitude":25.1558294,"content":{"data":{"content":"<p>Meydan Avenue, located in the heart of Dubai, is a prestigious development known for its blend of modern living and leisure facilities. This vibrant community is situated close to the iconic Meydan Racecourse, making it a prime location for equestrian enthusiasts and those seeking a dynamic urban lifestyle.</p><p>The area offers a variety of residential options, including stylish apartments and luxurious townhouses, all featuring contemporary designs and state-of-the-art amenities. The residences are complemented by lush green spaces, creating a serene and inviting environment.</p><p>Meydan Avenue is not just about residences; it's a hub for business, leisure, and entertainment. It features upscale retail outlets, fine dining restaurants, and cafes, alongside fitness centers and recreational areas. The community's strategic location provides easy access to Dubai's major attractions and business districts, making it ideal for professionals and families alike.</p>"}},"ggfx_results":[{"src_cftle":"i/meydan_avenue_522428ddee.jpg","transforms":[{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/x/1773x/meydan_avenue_522428ddee.webp","transform":"1773x","format":"webp"},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/x/376x/meydan_avenue_522428ddee.webp","transform":"376x","format":"webp"},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/x/744x/meydan_avenue_522428ddee.webp","transform":"744x","format":"webp"}]},{"src_cftle":"i/meydan_avenue_feature_c80f27fc5c.jpg","transforms":[{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/x/340x212/meydan_avenue_feature_c80f27fc5c.webp","transform":"340x212","format":"webp"},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/x/340x212/meydan_avenue_feature_c80f27fc5c.jpg","transform":"340x212","format":"jpg"},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/x/304x300/meydan_avenue_feature_c80f27fc5c.webp","transform":"304x300","format":"webp"}]}],"banner_image":{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/meydan_avenue_522428ddee.jpg"},"seo":{"id":"22251070-809f-5db3-9d47-47b022660e20","canonicalURL":null,"metaDescription":"Experience the allure of Meydan Avenue in Dubai, a community offering stylish apartments and townhouses near the Meydan Racecourse. ","metaTitle":"Meydan Avenue Dubai | Area & Community Guide","strapi_id":127}},"off_plans":{"nodes":[{"status":"pending","createdAt":"2025-09-10T12:31:00.482Z","min_bedrooms":1,"max_bedrooms":3,"display_address":"Meydan Avenue","display_bedrooms":null,"developer":"Elysian Developments","completion_year":"2027","id":"8b649c29-b8a9-555c-b480-5ce0147f5951","published_date":"2025-09-15T09